{
    "_note": "Scenarios for E10-06 (admin panel: customers, points ledger and purchases). Today is 2026-10-29 in America/Bogota. Merchants are referred to by NIT (800100100 El Rancho de Javi, 800200200 Cervecería BBC). Each scenario starts from the customers below with only the base accrual rule (1 point per $1.000, no promotions). The reversal window comes from movimientos-escenarios.json (E3-02) and the level thresholds from reglas-validas.json (plata 500, oro 1500, diamante 3000). Values the client has not confirmed carry \"_assumption\": true.",
